lay (which is good). I mostly played the game in multiplayer but you can play it alone as well both are good. The only negative is that the multiplayer isn't supported by steam itself which can cause problems for setting it up but for the rest it is a great game.", "timestamp_created": 1499437180, "timestamp_updated": 1499437180, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33339717", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072129817", "personaname": "ImABotKiller", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ImABotKiller/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 308, "playtime_forever": 1763, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 691, "last_played": 1530451762, "avatar": "a73a54e6bbd974fa329112384057f1847da92e5d"}, "language": "english", "review": "A good rogue-like game with randomized gameplay. Each class playstyle is unique. There are many ingame items with different effects so you can have many different builds. The coop is enjoyable. \n", "timestamp_created": 1499425929, "timestamp_updated": 1499425929, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}